                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Does System76 really show up in the BOARD manufacturer field?  I would expect that would show up in the PRODUCT manufacturer field."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/asrock_altrad8.json",
                    "line": 849,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Rebecca Cran",
                        "email": "rebecca@bsdio.com",
                        "username": "bexcran"
                    },
                    "message": "It shows up in both BOARD and PRODUCT manufacturer fields:\n```\n xyz.openbmc_project.FruDevice       interface -         -                       -\n.ADDRESS                            property  u         87                      emits-change\n.BOARD_INFO_AM1                     property  s         \"thelio-astra-a1\"       emits-change\n.BOARD_LANGUAGE_CODE                property  s         \"0\"                     emits-change\n.BOARD_MANUFACTURER                 property  s         \"System76\"              emits-change\n.BOARD_MANUFACTURE_DATE             property  s         \"2024-04-09 - 22:54:00\" emits-change\n.BOARD_PRODUCT_NAME                 property  s         \"Thelio Astra\"          emits-change\n.BOARD_SERIAL_NUMBER                property  s         \"BR80H1008200116\"       emits-change\n.BUS                                property  u         7                       emits-change\n.CHASSIS_INFO_AM1                   property  s         \"System76\"              emits-change\n.CHASSIS_INFO_AM2                   property  s         \"thelio-astra-a1\"       emits-change\n.CHASSIS_TYPE                       property  s         \"1\"                     emits-change\n.Common_Format_Version              property  s         \"1\"                     emits-change\n.PRODUCT_ASSET_TAG                  property  s         \"\"                      emits-change writable\n.PRODUCT_LANGUAGE_CODE              property  s         \"0\"                     emits-change\n.PRODUCT_MANUFACTURER               property  s         \"System76\"              emits-change\n.PRODUCT_PRODUCT_NAME               property  s         \"Thelio Astra\"          emits-change\n.PRODUCT_VERSION                    property  s         \"thelio-astra-a1\"       emits-change\n```"
                },
                {
